  prompt: `Build a self-contained, accessible native HTML/CSS/JavaScript interpretation of Dirty Rollin' Slider from https://drams.framer.website/drams/003. Credit DRAMS by 1042 Studio (@mrblackstudio and @karimeshrimp). A two-tone rolling ball travels through a shallow recessed track. Its coloured face rotates and changes hue as it rolls. Use a white 320px stage, soft neutral contact shadows, subtle physical edge highlights and orange details. drag the thumb, or focus it and use the arrow keys. Preserve pointer and keyboard operation, reduced-motion support and the distinct geometry of this component. No hosted Framer embed or external runtime dependency.`
